{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04885","headline":"奉和人日清晖阁宴羣臣遇雪应制 · 李乂","name":"奉和人日清晖阁宴羣臣遇雪应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上日登楼赏，中天御辇飞。\n後庭联舞唱，前席仰恩辉。\n睿作风云起，农祥雨雪霏。\n幸陪人胜节，长愿奉垂衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04885.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04885","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}